{"id": 77, "name": "Badang", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae19689ee111addb7f2c0e6f8f30a4ec.png", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Charge", "Burst"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["40", "70", "50", "10"], "lanes": ["Roam", "Exp Lane"], "story": "Island hero who gained supernatural power after defeating the water monster.", "skills": [{"name": "Chivalry Fist", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_383d73841ef661aedaf2529abdf25e9e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Every time Badang's Basic Attack hits a target, he gains a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chivalry Fist</span>. After gaining 4 stacks, his next Basic Attack deals 50<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> extra <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit and knocks them back. Enemies that are knocked into obstacles will be stunned for 0.6s (Minions and Creeps are stunned directly).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> generated by Badang's skills will trigger this effect directly, and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> from his Ultimate increases the stun duration to 1s."}, {"name": "Fist Wind", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1818e411e02a67d6dc086c65a8634392.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 2", "desc": "Badang unleashes a gust of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> in the target direction, dealing 125<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+90% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit, slowing them by 30% for 1.5s, and knocking them back. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> will explode upon hitting an obstacle, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> can trigger attack effects and grants Badang 1 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chivalry Fist</span> stack upon cast.\nBadang stores up to 2 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> charges and restores 1 charge every 10.4s."}, {"name": "Fist Break", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_caf5e5d46abcae913a11a2166ffb6979.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11", "desc": "Badang dashes in the target direction, dealing 230<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in his path while gaining a 350<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+150% Total Physical Attack)</span> shield that lasts 5s. He stops immediately upon hitting an enemy hero, slightly knocking them back while creating an obstacle that lasts 4s behind them. Enemies hit by the obstacle are dealt 130<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Badang removes the obstacle he created."}, {"name": "Fist Crack", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e140e6257393188d0b941bca2443577.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 45", "desc": "Badang throws a flurry of punches in the target direction, dealing 60<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+54% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit multiple times (can trigger attack effects). The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Fist Wind</span> generated by the punches will explode upon hitting an obstacle, dealing 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+27% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies.\nBadang is immune to control effects for the duration."}], "builds": [{"lane": "EXP", "winRate": 58.1, "pickRate": 1.33, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae89ce5b37dcd804686133c8d7044430.png", "attrs": ["+14 Adaptive Penetration", "+10 Adaptive Attack", "+3% Movement Speed"]}, "items": [{"name": "Demon Hunter Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f63658b2ae982d7684b74fca8163014.png"}, {"name": "Golden Staff", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_98d1154b4f017c7b68a4071e3c5e9364.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_282edd3dffb41e1b95b08592707ba88f.png"}]}, {"lane": "ROAM", "winRate": 57.7, "pickRate": 10.71, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Support", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3bd7417bce76995285722e25d8ff5ebd.png", "attrs": ["+12% Healing Effect", "+10% Cooldown Reduction", "+6% Movement Speed"]}, "items": [{"name": "Thunder Belt", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_efae63dc9b3da2bb48dbea60de7c79bc.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c76